<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ahold cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ahold cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Mark Hudson said he cut his rating on Koninklijke Ahold NV to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- He said he cut his 1996 earnings per share view to $2.29 from $2.38 and his 1997 EPS forecast to $2.69 from $2.71.</p>
<p>-- &quot;It's not that the company disappointed us, simply that we don't see Ahold pleasantly surprising us in the near-term; and at these valuations, surprises will be what it takes to further propel the share upwards,&quot; Husson said.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/4 to 63-5/8 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
